{"id": "De6tTOGyZrr", "title": "Video by artandartists_ai", "description": "Barsaat mein sab bheegte hain… woh bas apne aansu chhupaati hai 🌧️\n\nUsne dehleez se use jaate dekha tha: ek banjaara, kandhe pe potli, aur peeche lambi parchhaai.\nAb har baarish mein khidki pe uski saans se bana dil beh jaata hai, jhoola khaali jhoolta hai, aur charpai ka aadha hissa khaali rehta hai.\nToofaan mein woh aangan mein khadi ho jaati hai… taaki koi na jaane kaunsi boond baarish hai aur kaunsa aansu.\nSubah woh neem pe ek laal dhaaga baandh deti hai. Uske laut aane ke liye nahi… bas uski salaamati ke liye 🤍\n\n🎵 Barsaat · Banjaare (Sumit & Anuj) @official_banjaare\n\nUsko bhejo jise har baarish mein koi yaad aata hai\n\nBarsaat Banjaare | Barsaat song | Banjaare songs | Bairan Banjaare | Haryanvi sad song | baarish sad song | monsoon sad song | ink illustration animation | etching art | animated music video | Hindi sad songs\n\n#Barsaat #Banjaare #Bairan #HaryanviSongs #InkArt", "channel": "artandartists_ai", "uploader_id": "17104311819", "uploader": "Art & Artists - AI", "timestamp": 1792931364, "like_count": 963, "comment_count": 15, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1500419678626859a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 64.911, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOaZUB6LXbWjJf2KASAVylySkPKfaXvIAJYJemokDDFuawItEgmxYg4wc0AdK8raUjMu0U0cjJGAgSpHtAl4P6NAjsUxUXtlx2LI38.mp4?_nc_cat=104&_nc_oc=AdrnNjK4SUpfraDR72meRvfMFXnjK39-4lf1EHWNjWHCOSahL6F7wZFPbK4PPQQJKNov1hp1o6VcpFYHElUKtNTy&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=dlBzVyjtI3kQ7kNvwHYI8e0&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=3-bTD0A6Bir00ZTDS42Ctg&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQTi0FIu04_ovIXoB-BAxHlQUCh19-bg-mtnXrKlnHztiA&oe=6AF449AD", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio